{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rummix</strong> is a fast, minimalist puzzle game inspired by classic Rummy mechanics and modern score-chasing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide rows and columns to create matches of <strong>equal numbers</strong> or <strong>consecutive sequences</strong>. Every move matters. Fail to make a match in time, and the game is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rummix focuses on pure logic and risk-reward decisions, where planning ahead is just as important as reacting under pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Rummy-inspired matching</strong>: Match equal numbers or clean ascending/descending sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 <strong>Limited movement system</strong>: Rows and columns lock until you make a match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Score-chasing gameplay</strong>: Build multipliers and push for high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>High tension</strong>: Too many moves without a match ends the run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Minimalist visuals</strong>: Clear, readable, and satisfying animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Endless replayability</strong>: Every run plays differently</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn. Hard to master.<br><strong>Rummix</strong> rewards planning, pattern recognition, and calm decision-making under pressure.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874320/89031dc5e7a7f1256dbec24489b3c4afaa9209c6.jpg"},{"name":"B","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874320/d926677fa164942a3d33fb34098271b550c60240.jpg"},{"name":"C","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/387